{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"[{\"title\":\"Assassination Time\",\"number\":1,\"airDate\":\"2015-01-10\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"A creature who blasted the moon into a crescent shows up at Kunugigaoka Junior High School--and he's giving the students a year to assassinate him!\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/283947/4937696.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"暗殺の時間\"},{\"title\":\"Baseball Time\",\"number\":2,\"airDate\":\"2015-01-17\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"The reasoning behind the E Class's segregation is revealed. Nagisa tracks Koro Sensei's weak points in the hopes of using them to take him down.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/283947/5097574.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"野球の時間\"},{\"title\":\"Karma Time\",\"number\":3,\"airDate\":\"2015-01-31\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"The brilliant, belligerent Karma Akabane, Nagisa's former classmate, joins 3-E and immediately jumps into the assassination mission with both feet.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/283947/5097575.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"カルマの時間\"},{\"title\":\"Grown-Up Time\",\"number\":4,\"airDate\":\"2015-02-07\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"A new foreign-language teacher comes to 3-E with some major ulterior motives... among other things. Will she get any closer to killing Koro Sensei?\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/283947/5097576.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"大人の時間\"},{\"title\":\"Assembly Time\",\"number\":5,\"airDate\":\"2015-02-14\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"Before the torturous school assembly begins, Okuda attempts to poison Koro Sensei in an unexpected way... with unexpected results.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/283947/5107725.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"集会の時間\"},{\"title\":\"Test Time\",\"number\":6,\"airDate\":\"2015-02-21\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"Time for midterms! Koro Sensei gives his aspiring assassins an ul