d Time\",\"number\":17,\"airDate\":\"2015-05-16\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"The E Class trains intently under a pro killer to prepare for their island assassination. Once there, they must make sure everything falls into place.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/283947/5164684.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"島の時間\"},{\"title\":\"Action Time\",\"number\":18,\"airDate\":\"2015-05-23\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"The summer assassination attempt is followed by a crisis affecting nearly half the E Class. Can the rest think and move fast enough to save them?\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/283947/5164685.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"決行の時間\"},{\"title\":\"Pandemonium Time\",\"number\":19,\"airDate\":\"2015-05-30\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"The E Class must put their lessons into practice as they tackle an intimidating hotel brimming with baddies--and all without Koro Sensei's help.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/283947/5164686.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"伏魔の時間\"},{\"title\":\"Karma Time: 2nd Period\",\"number\":20,\"airDate\":\"2015-06-06\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"Karma must use his head to get past a formidable foe. Nagisa goes undercover as the E Class continues to sneak its way to the hotel's top floor.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/283947/5164687.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"カルマの時間 2時間目\"},{\"title\":\"XX Time\",\"number\":21,\"airDate\":\"2015-06-13\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"The students take on one last assassin opponent before meeting the shadowy figure who's holding the virus remedy hostage in exhange for Koro Sensei.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/283947/5164688.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"xxの時間\"},{\"title\":\"Nagisa Time\",\"number\":22,\"airDate\":\"2015-06-20\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"Before Nagisa completely gives into his anger, Terasaka throws a stun-gun at him, urging him not to become a murderer and think about what's truly important.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/283947/5164689.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"渚の時間\"}]","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":3600,"tags":[]}